   "source": [
    "**1. Préparation des données**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "88a5df04-46eb-4468-81b4-44fa8c89d662",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Fichiers nécessaires :**  \n",
    "- `pois.csv` : Colonnes `ID, Place_Name, Lat, Long`  \n",
    "- `ratings.csv` : Colonnes `user_id, ID, rating` (notes de sécurité)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "d5141181-f0f1-40bb-8cd2-273e43edb433",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "   ID                  Place_Name        Lat      Long\n",
      "0   1  Jardin_pub_ancien_Talborjt  30.427320 -9.613649\n",
      "1   2             Jardin_Dikrayat  30.425532 -9.611122\n",
      "2   3              Mssala_Ihchach  30.427142 -9.608285\n",
      "3   4              Parking_Wilaya  30.421990 -9.604948\n",
      "4   5         Rue_de_Paris_PLACE1  30.424987 -9.604443\n",
      "   user_id  ID  rating\n",
      "0        1   3     4.5\n",
      "1        2   3     3.5\n",
